ke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>So while most people are fixated on the AI infrastructure build, what interests me is the process underneath it, the renewal and reindustrialization of the physical base.</p><div class=\"digest-post-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;nodeId&quot;:&quot;0f93ca6f-4503-41e5-bab5-45128ee62357&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Where do we get our minerals of war and why does it matter?&quot;,&quot;cta&quot;:null,&quot;showBylines&quot;:true,&quot;showDescription&quot;:true,&quot;showImage&quot;:true,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;sm&quot;,&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;The Arsenal of Autocracy&quot;,&quot;publishedBylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:27115489,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Alexander Campbell&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Founder @Rose.AI\\nPreviously at Bridgewater, Lehman. &quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/615b2fcd-98b6-4beb-89b3-cc56ac17c33c_400x400.jpeg&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:null}],&quot;post_date&quot;:&quot;2025-09-28T16:25:01.491Z&quot;,&quot;cover_image&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Cnud!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F17836644-5509-4069-a78c-6e18bb45fb01_2093x906.png&quot;,&quot;cover_image_alt&quot;:null,&quot;cover_image_crop&quot;:null,&quot;canonical_url&quot;:&quot;https://www.campbellramble.ai/p/the-arsenal-of-autocracy&quot;,&quot;section_name&quot;:null,&quot;video_upload_id&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:174761072,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;newsletter&quot;,&quot;reaction_count&quot;:30,&quot;comment_count&quot;:19,&quot;publication_id&quot;:312411,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;Campbell Ramble&quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KTpD!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcfe3791b-6bb6-4230-8940-054d6dd3133f_332x332.png&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;youtube_url&quot;:null,&quot;show_links&quot;:null,&quot;feed_url&quot;:null}\"></div><p>You\u2019ll hear plenty of people defend the old ways. A world where nations didn\u2019t need borders, and it felt normal to let your adversary disassemble your industrial base and ship it home, not as reparations after a war but in exchange for an endless stream of plastic slop for our shops and homes.</p><p>Me? I\u2019m looking for every way I can to buy compute, machines, and the land and minerals that grow them. Next time we start building the portfolio, public and private, that expresses this view.</p><p>Over the break I got that process going by taking out a fixed-rate mortgage to buy some land, now 125bps below spot. Sometimes the best way to sell bonds is to borrow a lot of money. Just try not to get overlevered. Ask Leo. The Fed is, after all, tightening, and the goal of tightening, always, is to raise the cost of capital right when it feels most free, to acid test the most aggressive world views against the spreadsheet calculus of cash flows. The singularity may be here, but the capital cycle is immortal. And all that compute is anything but free.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Nlq!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe71169b3-4d6b-4fc9-9ef6-653ad6c18880_2546x1162.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Nlq!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe71169b3-4d6b-4fc9-9ef6-653ad6c18880_2546x1162.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Nlq!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe71169b3-4d6b-4fc9-9ef6-653ad6c18880_2546x1162.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Nlq!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe71169b3-4d6b-4fc9-9ef6-653ad6c18880_2546x1162.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Nlq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe71169b3-4d6b-4fc9-9ef6-653ad6c18880_2546x1162.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Nlq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe71169b3-4d6b-4fc9-9ef6-653ad6c18880_2546x1162.png\" width=\"1